# ---------------- TK_Enemy.events (Task 16 Part F: two-player scene) ----------------
# The enemy sheet for TK4Multiplayer.scene. It is the same TK4 zombie as Enemy.events, but
# every target is written as `player` / `nearest player` instead of the single `Player`
# actor, so the same sheet hunts either local player:
#   * `when me sees player` fires for Player1 or Player2 (the group match in NameMatches),
#   * `goto nearest player` re-picks the closest one on every chase tick.
# `my TargetPlayer` is computed by the runtime, so a HUD line can show who is being hunted:
#   bind TargetLabel to my TargetPlayer format "Hunting: {0}"
#
# SETUP (editor): the Enemy actor -> EventSheet -> Event File = TK_Enemy.

when me appears
  enemy type "Zombie"
  set my mode to "patrol"
  goto random Waypoint speed 100 facing forward

when me arrives at Waypoint
  my Speed is higher than 0
  wait random 0.5 to 2 seconds
  goto random Waypoint speed 100

# ---- sight: either player brings it running ----
when me sees player by my SightDistance
  my Speed is higher than 0
  set my mode to "chase"
  print "TK_Enemy: spotted a player"

# ---- hearing (Part B): a gunshot from either player is a lead ----
when me hears "gunshot" by my SightDistance
  my Hostile is true
  set my mode to "chase"
  goto other speed 100 facing forward

# Chase re-targets the nearest player, so a second player walking past steals the aggro.
when every 0.2 seconds
  my mode is "chase"
  my Speed is higher than 0
  goto nearest player speed 100 facing forward

when me stops seeing player
  set my mode to "patrol"
  goto random Waypoint speed 100 facing forward

# ---- attack: whoever it is standing next to ----
when me is near player by 1.5
  my mode is "chase"
  my Hostile is true
  play anim "Attack"
  send message "hurt" to nearest player

# ---- damage and death (Parts C.5 + E) ----
when message "damage" arrives
  spawn Blood at me
  set my LastDmg to other's damage
  set my health to my health - my LastDmg

when my health becomes 0
  if my ExplosionDeath is true
  spawn Explosion at me
  otherwise
  spawn Gib at me offset 0
  spawn Gib at me offset 12
  spawn Gib at me offset -12
  destroy me
